      Self-Calibrated mmWave Radar Network," 2025 IEEE Radar Conference
      (RadarConf25), pp. 1116-1121, 2025.
      doi:10.1109/RadarConf2559087.2025.11205142

  [2] A. Banik, Y. Mostofi, A. Sabharwal and U. Madhow, "Optimal
      Self-Calibration for Collaborative Sensing in mmWave Radar Networks,"
      2024 58th Asilomar Conference on Signals, Systems, and Computers,
      pp. 218-222, 2024. doi:10.1109/IEEECONF60004.2024.10942741

